Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 09:11:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 190/244] Ensure agent responses are sent to the correct chat
 session

Modify the injectToGateway function to accept an optional target session, ensuring responses are sent back to the originating chat session instead of always defaulting to the webchat session.

Replit-Commit-Author: Agent
Replit-Commit-Session-Id: 906b397c-0d51-4c51-938d-028fd77f33b5
Replit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint
